WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:06.979
Every shift belongs to a venue. This
tutorial shows how to add one, using

2
00:00:06.979 --> 00:00:08.877
fictional demonstration data.

3
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:11.445
On Venues, select New venue.

4
00:00:11.967 --> 00:00:14.966
Enter the venue name, the client and the
venue type.

5
00:00:18.133 --> 00:00:19.373
Add the address.

6
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:29.033
Set the location and the geofence radius.
Staff must be inside this area to clock in

7
00:00:29.033 --> 00:00:31.009
when the geofence is enforced.

8
00:00:31.533 --> 00:00:33.588
Set the default break in minutes.

9
00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:38.255
Select Create venue. The drawer stays open
so you can add pay rates.

10
00:00:38.767 --> 00:00:42.948
Add an hourly rate for a role at this
venue, then select Save changes.

11
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:48.121
The new venue appears in the list.
